# FA contribution owners: Kaung Khant Thein, Kaung Min Khant, and Fatin Farha Binte Sahidin
# Purpose: Excludes secrets, development output, tests, and documentation from Docker contexts.
# Demo focus: Show that .env files and repository metadata cannot enter either image build context.
node_modules
.git
.github
.agents
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.log
coverage
.nyc_output
test
docs
scripts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode
.idea
*.md
